{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20188","headline":"列仙文 安度明 · 孟郊","name":"列仙文 安度明","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹霞焕上清，八风鼓太和。\n回我神霄辇，遂造岭玉阿。\n咄嗟天地外，九围皆我家。\n上采白日精，下饮黄月华。\n灵观空无中，鹏路无间邪。\n顾见魏贤安，浊气伤汝和。\n勤研玄中思，道成更相过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}